ndel finished: a fern corner."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"Breakfast from the pantry."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"The rain barrel filled, and its water went into the store."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"A soft drizzle passed over. The dew will be good tomorrow."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"A breeze rattled the trees and dropped some twigs by the door."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"Hazel picked lettuces. Into the pantry they go, and the ground remembers a little more of how to grow."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"The pantry shelf was full, so the spare lettuces went on the compost heap, and a few to the rabbit."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"Hazel sowed beans across the bed. They want water."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"Wendel watered the bed. Now it grows."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"A warm hush over the bed, and beans fill out all at once."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"Beans are ready to pick."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"Hazel set to work: dress the house for spring."},{"t":1793566800000,"text":"Wendel set to work: gather moss off the old stumps."},{"t":1793566920000,"text":"Hazel picked beans. Into the pantry they go, and the ground remembers a little more of how to grow."},{"t":1793566920000,"text":"The pantry shelf was full, so the spare beans went on the compost heap, and a few to the rabbit."},{"t":1793566920000,"text":"Hazel sowed carrots across the bed. They want water."},{"t":1793566920000,"text":"Wendel watered the bed. Now it grows."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"Carrots are ready to pick."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"Hazel finished: dress the house for spring."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"Wendel finished: gather moss off the old stumps."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"The two of them took tea on the bench and watched the light change."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"Hazel picked carrots. Into the pantry they go, and the ground remembers a little more of how to grow."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"The pantry shelf was full, so the spare carrots went on the compost heap, and a few to the rabbit."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"Hazel sowed lettuces across the bed. They want water."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"Wendel watered the bed. Now it grows."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"Hazel set to work: gather moss off the old stumps."},{"t":1793584800000,"text":"Wendel set to work: pick up sticks round the edge."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Lettuces are ready to pick."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Hazel finished: gather moss off the old stumps."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Wendel finished: pick up sticks round the edge."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Supper from the pantry."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"The rain barrel filled, and its water went into the store."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Three wisps of light drifted through, as if looking for the gnomes."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"A hungry rabbit nibbled the clover and left a seed in apology."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Hazel picked lettuces. Into the pantry they go, and the ground remembers a little more of how to grow."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"The pantry shelf was full, so the spare lettuces went on the compost heap, and a few to the rabbit."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Hazel sowed beans across the bed. They want water."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Wendel watered the bed. Now it grows."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Hazel set to work: a stone frog."},{"t":1793606400000,"text":"Wendel set to work: a mossy log bench."}],"spellsUsed":{"coax":"2026-11-2"},"flags":{"r6":true,"trim86":true,"welcomed":true,"pageDay":"2026-10-31","rabbit":true,"picked:carrot":true,"firstpick":true,"picked:lettuce":true,"sown:pumpkin":true,"pumpkinYear":2026,"picked:pumpkin":true,"pumpkin":true,"picked:bean":true,"owlHome":1793325600000,"garden":true},"events":{"lastAt":1793606400000,"seen":{"breeze":9,"firefly":4,"drizzle":6,"berries":2,"rabbit":6,"chicks":2,"wattle":2,"wash":1,"neighbours":1,"dance":1,"tea":4,"seedwind":2,"gift":2,"storm":3,"blossom":1}},"story":{"chapter":0,"flags":{},"found":[]},"village":{"tr